<title>USA: PHLX to list options on Western Wireless.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list options on Western Wireless.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said on Monday it would list options on shares of Western Wireless Corp on August 28.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will have initial expiration months of September, October, November and February, and initial strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20.</p>
<p>It said Susquehanna Investment Group will be the specialist for the options.</p>
<p>--Chicago derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
